&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building with large language models, whether through coursework, projects, or self-directed work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Proficient in at least one language you love, and eager to learn new ones&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
