&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Construction Management, Business, or a related technical field. Equivalent experience may be considered in lieu of a degree.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
