&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lead the Leave, Accommodations &amp;amp; Workers&#39; Compensation Team&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
