&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;1+ years of experience performing building maintenance, construction repairs, or related work, with attention to the quality of completed repairs and finishes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to provide before-and-after photos demonstrating relevant prior repair or finishing work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
