&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Valid California driver’s license, acceptable driving record, and reliable transportation to complete assigned shifts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
