&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Willingness to learn multiple facility trades and systems and work non-standard shifts, overtime, and weekends as required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
