&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Identify process bottlenecks and winding defects, and support troubleshooting and root-cause solutions with engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
