&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with flight hardware, high-value hardware, or other controlled hardware while following defined production, quality, or operational procedures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
