&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;2+ years of experience in an Inventory/Logistics Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
