&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Machine Shop team delivers high-precision, high-quality machined components that are critical to Terran R’s&amp;nbsp;success. Here, you’ll combine technical skill with creativity, collaborating closely with engineering and design&amp;nbsp;teams to drive better part designs and manufacturing solutions. You’ll work with best-in-class, premium machinery&amp;nbsp;and get to bring our expanded, state-of-the-art machine shop to life to support the scale and pace of the Terran R&amp;nbsp;program. This role offers the rare chance to see your craftsmanship directly integrated into flight hardware,&amp;nbsp;making an immediate impact. With clear training pathways, you’ll have opportunities to advance from operating&amp;nbsp;machines to programming them, growing your career alongside the program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
