&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A high level of attention to detail is crucial for conducting thorough inspections and ensuring compliance with quality standards and regulations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
