&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience partnering with manufacturing engineers and CNC programmers in a production, development, or R&amp;amp;D environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
