&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Act as a thought leader for relevant commodities, continuously improving sourcing processes, supplier health, and program readiness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
