&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;exmkt0&quot; data-start=&quot;2986&quot; data-end=&quot;3077&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience troubleshooting mechanical or fluid systems and resolving operational issues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
