&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-uuid=&quot;f7809722-3db5-449f-ba2e-73b9a0d656d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Identify qualification envelopes, form test plans, execute characterization campaigns, and analyze data for flight qualification and usage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-uuid=&quot;175adc8d-857e-46c0-8ecc-d4d152791db3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop, implement, and maintain technical specifications and engineering standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
