&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-uuid=&quot;2b541a74-ea64-4676-9ee6-9dc8d148f083&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Laboratory staff to characterize&amp;nbsp;materials&amp;nbsp;and processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
