&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-uuid=&quot;3160b028-352f-418d-b5d7-1de5aaeabf9b&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manufacturing and TPS engineers to develop processes, troubleshoot issues, and enable cost &amp;amp; rate while maintaining required performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
