&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You can independently fabricate and install carbon steel, stainless steel, and other piping systems, while meeting project specifications, quality standards, and safety requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You can identify and troubleshoot fit-up, alignment, dimensional, and installation issues and make sound decisions to resolve field challenges efficiently. o You can effectively coordinate with other trades and lead or mentor less-experienced pipe fitters, providing direction and ensuring work is completed safely and to specification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
