&lt;div class=&quot;sc-kafWEX fhapOw&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Extensive experience with industrial piping fabrication, installation, maintenance, commissioning, shutdowns, or turnaround work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
