&lt;div class=&quot;sc-kafWEX fhapOw&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Previous experience as a lead pipe fitter, foreman, or crew lead, including assigning work, coordinating manpower, monitoring quality, and mentoring junior team members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
