&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of structural analysis (hand calculation, Finite Elements Methods and industry tools) and test&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
