&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of enterprise applications (i.e., PLM, ERP, MES) and proficient in data analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Self-starter that has demonstrated the ability to define and own a process from scratch and roll out that process through adept communication to a diverse team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with New Product Development and PPAP implementation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
