&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;3+ years of working in a supply chain engineering, product engineering, software engineering &amp;nbsp;or product management role with a focus on MRP or ERP systems within an advanced manufacturing environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in programming languages such as Python, SQL, Javascript, Java, C#&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
