&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive multidisciplinary teams including metrology technicians, quality engineers, and operations personnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Define the long-term calibration strategy and roadmap, including evaluation of bringing calibration capabilities in-house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure vendors maintain compliance with ISO/IEC 17025, ANSI/NCSL Z540.3, AS9100, and NASA requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Provide expert technical guidance on metrology and calibration, ensuring integrity and accuracy of measurement data used for critical decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Review calibration certificates and technical documentation, and maintain equipment tracking systems and calibration databases (e.g., Indysoft)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
