&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Serve as the company-wide technical authority for precision cleaning, fluid system cleanliness, contamination control, passivation, and associated special processes, establishing the standards and technical strategy necessary to ensure hardware quality and reliability from piece-part manufacturing through vehicle integration, testing, and launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
