&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;8+ years of relevant experience, preferably in complex engineering system development and/or test environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
