&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proficient with one or more fluid or thermal modeling tools for internal compressible and incompressible fluid analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
