&lt;p class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a 2nd shift position with a standard schedule of 3pm-1:30am PT, Monday through Friday. Please note that this position is structured around a baseline expectation of a 50-hour workweek. In addition to your salary, employees receive a 10% shift differential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
