&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Support program managers in leadership development and orientation/onboarding by coordinating logistical aspects of learning programs, including scheduling, attendance tracking, materials preparation, and follow-up communications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
